{"id":1026,"date":"2019-03-18T08:33:54","date_gmt":"2019-03-18T08:33:54","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost\/consultax\/?page_id=1026"},"modified":"2022-04-27T10:50:01","modified_gmt":"2022-04-27T10:50:01","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"Company overview"},"content":{"rendered":"<section class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row el_class=&#8221;section-padd&#8221;][vc_column width=&#8221;2\/3&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1651056242543{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p class=\"title\">Impact StratCom is an integrated communications agency based in East Africa with offices in Nairobi, Kenya. As one of East Africa\u2019s largest communication agencies by clients, we focus on strategic communications, content creation, digital branding, social media management, editorial events, building audiences as well as viral marketing projects. We effectively work with clients to establish effective public relations campaigns to reach the target audiences, mitigate risk, monitor media and do social media monitoring.<\/p>\n<p>We are equipped with a resourceful team who are the best-skilled PR practitioners that have been working in East Africa\u2019s communication industry for more than two decades. Impact StratCom is a dynamic agency with a strong track record in delivering tailored public relations, content development, marketing, and digital campaigns in East Africa since 2013. We\u2019re working closely with clients from the public to private sectors to ensure their messages are heard. Working in East Africa\u2019s unique environment \u2013 we know what works and how to tell compelling stories.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1631603422685{background-color: #b01f30 !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;border-radius: 5px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text \"><\/div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 delaware-icon-box delaware-icon-box-3 \">\n<div class=\"emtry-content\">\n<h6 class=\"emtry-title\" style=\"color: #fff;\">Our Vision<\/h6>\n<div class=\"descreption\">\n<p style=\"color: #fff;\">To be the leading communication consultancy service provider in EASTof Africa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #fff;\">__________________________<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 delaware-icon-box delaware-icon-box-3 \" style=\"color: #fff;\">\n<div class=\"emtry-content\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n<h6 class=\"emtry-title\" style=\"color: #fff;\">Our Mission<\/h6>\n<div class=\"descreption\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our mission is to provide communication consultancy, branding and corporate identity in order to improve our client\u2019s productivity and services.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 delaware-icon-box delaware-icon-box-3 \">\n<div class=\"emtry-content\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;12px&#8221;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row equal_height=&#8221;yes&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1631613191537{border-bottom-width: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column width=&#8221;7\/12&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1651056338492{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"title\"><strong>History &amp; Background Information<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Impact StratCom has more than eight years of experience in bringing greater visibility to businesses, government, and non- governmental organizations in East Africa. Established in early 2013, we started under the trading name of Impact Advertising Group. It was one of the first functioning advertising companies in East Africa and has vast experience in branding and communication, and billboard advertising, among other platforms. However, Impact Advertising Group was rebranded as Impact StratCom to undertake other strategic communications-related activities.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;5\/12&#8243;]\n    <div class=\"image-carousel ot_slider_height\" data-show=\"1\" data-arrow=\"true\">\n                <div>\n            <div class=\"img-item\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1169\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about1.jpg 1169w, https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about1-300x128.jpg 300w, https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about1-1024x438.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about1-768x328.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1169px) 100vw, 1169px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n                <div>\n            <div class=\"img-item\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1169\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about2.jpg 1169w, https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about2-300x128.jpg 300w, https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about2-1024x438.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/impactcoms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/about2-768x328.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1169px) 100vw, 1169px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n\n    [\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1553073137449{padding-top: 80px !important;p